<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Alpha Funnel — {{ meta.as_of }}</title>
{% if needs_plotly %}<script>{{ plotly_js }}</script>{% endif %}
<style>
:root{--bg:#0d1117;--panel:#161b22;--panel2:#1c2128;--grid:#21262d;--fg:#c9d1d9;
--muted:#8b949e;--up:#3fb950;--down:#f85149;--accent:#58a6ff;--warn:#d29922;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);
font:14px/1.55 Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 80px}
h1,h2,h3,h4{margin:0 0 .4em;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h1{font-size:26px}h2{font-size:19px;margin-top:34px}h3{font-size:16px}
a{color:var(--accent)}
.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid);padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:8px}
.badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.badge{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--grid);border-radius:6px;
padding:5px 11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.badge b{color:var(--fg);font-weight:600}
.badge.regime-RISK_ON{border-color:var(--up);color:var(--up)}
.badge.regime-RISK_OFF{border-color:var(--down);color:var(--down)}
.badge.regime-LATE_CYCLE{border-color:var(--warn);color:var(--warn)}
.badge.regime-RECOVERY{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--grid);border-radius:10px;
padding:18px 20px;margin:16px 0}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid);vertical-align:top}
th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.06em}
tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
td.num,th.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.score{font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.s-high{color:var(--up)}.s-mid{color:var(--warn)}.s-low{color:var(--muted)}
.tkr{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
.chart{margin:14px 0}
.chart img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:8px}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
@media(max-width:820px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.name{page-break-before:always;border-top:2px solid var(--grid);padding-top:26px;
margin-top:34px}
.name:first-of-type{page-break-before:avoid}
.namehead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pill{font-size:11px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--panel2);
color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--grid)}
.pill.high{color:var(--up);border-color:var(--up)}
.pill.medium{color:var(--warn);border-color:var(--warn)}
.pill.low{color:var(--muted)}
.subs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin:12px 0}
.sub-chip{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--grid);border-radius:6px;
padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px}
.sub-chip b{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--fg);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sub-chip span{color:var(--muted)}
.thesis{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;margin:12px 0}
.bb{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:14px 0}
@media(max-width:820px){.bb{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.bull{border-left:3px solid var(--up);padding-left:13px}
.bear{border-left:3px solid var(--down);padding-left:13px}
.inval{border-left:3px solid var(--warn);padding-left:13px;margin:14px 0;
background:rgba(210,153,34,.06);padding:12px 13px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.inval b{color:var(--warn)}
ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:3px 0}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.warnbox{border:1px solid var(--warn);background:rgba(210,153,34,.08);
border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;margin:16px 0;color:var(--warn)}
/* Partial-data mode. Deliberately loud and repeated on every block, so a card
   screenshotted on its own still carries the caveat. */
.modebanner{border:2px solid var(--down);background:rgba(216,74,74,.12);
border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0;color:var(--down);
font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px}
.modebanner.card-mode{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:11px;padding:7px 11px}
footer{margin-top:56px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--grid);
color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}
code{background:var(--panel2);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}
@media print{body{background:#fff;color:#111}.card{border-color:#ddd;background:#fff}}
</style>
</head>
<body><div class="wrap">

<header>
  <h1>Daily Equity Alpha Funnel</h1>
  {% if meta.mode_label %}<div class="modebanner">{{ meta.mode_label }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="sub">{{ meta.as_of }} &middot; run <code>{{ meta.run_id }}</code>
    &middot; generated {{ meta.generated_at }}</div>
  <div class="badges">
    <span class="badge regime-{{ macro.regime }}">Regime <b>{{ macro.regime }}</b></span>
    <span class="badge">Universe <b>{{ '{:,}'.format(funnel.values()|list|first) }}</b></span>
    {% for stage, n in funnel.items() %}<span class="badge">{{ stage }} <b>{{ '{:,}'.format(n) }}</b></span>{% endfor %}
    <span class="badge">Cost <b>${{ '%.3f'|format(cost.cost_usd) }}</b></span>
    <span class="badge">Runtime <b>{{ '%.1f'|format(meta.duration_s) }}s</b></span>
  </div>
</header>

{% if warnings %}
{% for w in warnings %}<div class="warnbox">{{ w }}</div>{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<h2>Executive summary</h2>
<div class="card">
{% if meta.mode_label %}<div class="modebanner card-mode">{{ meta.mode_label }}</div>{% endif %}
<table>
<thead><tr>
  <th>#</th><th>Ticker</th><th>Sector</th><th class="num">Score</th>
  <th>Conviction</th><th>Thesis</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for n in names %}
<tr>
  <td class="muted">{{ loop.index }}</td>
  <td class="tkr">{{ n.ticker }}</td>
  <td class="muted">{{ n.sector }}</td>
  <td class="num score {{ 's-high' if n.total_score >= 75 else ('s-mid' if n.total_score >= 60 else 's-low') }}">{{ n.total_score }}</td>
  <td><span class="pill {{ n.conviction }}">{{ n.conviction }}</span></td>
  <td>{{ n.one_liner }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
{% if not names and not deterministic_names %}<p class="muted">No names cleared the funnel today.</p>{% endif %}
</div>

{% if deterministic_names %}
<div class="card">
{% if meta.mode_label %}<div class="modebanner card-mode">{{ meta.mode_label }}</div>{% endif %}
<h3>Deterministic ranking — Stages 0-3 only</h3>
<p class="sub">No language model ran. These are the funnel's own scores: a
sector-neutral factor composite blended with the catalyst score and tilted by
the macro regime. There is no thesis text because there is nothing to write it.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr>
  <th>#</th><th>Ticker</th><th>Sector</th><th class="num">Blended</th>
  <th class="num">Factor</th><th class="num">Catalyst</th>
  <th class="num">Mom</th><th class="num">Qual</th><th class="num">Rev</th>
  <th class="num">PEAD</th><th class="num">Val</th><th class="num">Data</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for r in deterministic_names %}
<tr>
  <td class="muted">{{ r.rank }}</td>
  <td class="tkr">{{ r.ticker }}</td>
  <td class="muted">{{ r.sector }}</td>
  <td class="num score">{{ '%.2f'|format(r.stage3_score or 0) }}</td>
  <td class="num">{{ '%.2f'|format(r.factor_composite or 0) }}</td>
  <td class="num">{{ '%.1f'|format(r.catalyst_score or 0) }}</td>
  {% for c in ['momentum','quality','revisions','pead','value'] %}
  <td class="num muted">{{ '%.2f'|format(r.categories[c] or 0) }}</td>
  {% endfor %}
  <td class="num muted">{{ '%.0f%%'|format((r.data_completeness or 0) * 100) }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody></table>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Funnel and market structure</h2>
<div class="grid2">
  <div class="card">{{ render_chart(charts.funnel) }}</div>
  <div class="card">{{ render_chart(charts.sector_heatmap) }}</div>
</div>
<div class="card">{{ render_chart(charts.macro) }}
  <p class="sub">Regime score {{ macro.score }}.
  {% for k, v in macro.levels.items() %}<code>{{ k }}={{ v }}</code> {% endfor %}</p>
</div>

<h2>Deep dives</h2>
{% for n in names %}
<section class="name">
  {% if meta.mode_label %}<div class="modebanner card-mode">{{ meta.mode_label }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="namehead">
    <h3 class="tkr">{{ n.ticker }}</h3>
    <span class="pill">{{ n.sector }}</span>
    <span class="pill {{ n.conviction }}">{{ n.conviction }} conviction</span>
    <span class="pill">{{ n.time_horizon_days }}d horizon</span>
    <span class="score s-high" style="margin-left:auto;font-size:24px">{{ n.total_score }}<span class="muted" style="font-size:13px">/100</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="subs">
  {% for k, v in n.subscores.items() %}
    <div class="sub-chip"><b>{{ v }}</b><span>{{ k }} /{{ rubric_max[k] }}</span></div>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="thesis">{{ n.thesis }}</p>

  <div class="bb">
    <div class="bull"><b>Bull case</b><br>{{ n.bull_case }}</div>
    <div class="bear"><b>Bear case</b><br>{{ n.bear_case }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="inval"><b>Invalidation.</b> {{ n.invalidation }}</div>

  {% if n.key_risks %}
  <p><b>Key risks</b></p><ul>{% for r in n.key_risks %}<li>{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {% endif %}
  {% if n.catalysts_ahead %}
  <p><b>Catalysts ahead</b></p><ul>
  {% for c in n.catalysts_ahead %}<li>{{ c.event }}{% if c.date %} <span class="muted">— {{ c.date }}</span>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="chart">{{ render_chart(n.charts.price) }}</div>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div>{{ render_chart(n.charts.radar) }}</div>
    <div>{{ render_chart(n.charts.fundamentals) }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div>{{ render_chart(n.charts.news) }}</div>
    <div>{{ render_chart(n.charts.peers) }}</div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<h2>Appendix</h2>

<h3>Near misses — ranked 11-25</h3>
<div class="card">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Ticker</th><th>Sector</th><th class="num">Triage</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for r in near_misses %}
<tr><td class="muted">{{ loop.index + names|length }}</td><td class="tkr">{{ r.ticker }}</td>
<td class="muted">{{ r.sector }}</td><td class="num">{{ '%.0f'|format(r.score) }}</td>
<td class="muted">{{ r.why }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody></table>
{% if not near_misses %}<p class="muted">None recorded.</p>{% endif %}
</div>

<h3>Factor weights used</h3>
<div class="card">
<table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th class="num">Weight</th><th>Factors</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for cat, w in weights.categories.items() %}
<tr><td>{{ cat }}</td><td class="num">{{ '%.2f'|format(w) }}</td>
<td class="muted">{{ weights.factors[cat]|join(', ') }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
</div>

<h3>Data completeness</h3>
<div class="card">
<table><thead><tr><th>Ticker</th><th class="num">Overall</th>
{% for c in completeness_categories %}<th class="num">{{ c }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for r in completeness %}
<tr><td class="tkr">{{ r.ticker }}</td><td class="num">{{ '%.0f%%'|format(r.overall * 100) }}</td>
{% for c in completeness_categories %}<td class="num muted">{{ '%.0f%%'|format((r[c] or 0) * 100) }}</td>{% endfor %}
</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
</div>

<h3>API calls and cost</h3>
<div class="card">
<table><thead><tr><th>Source</th><th class="num">Calls</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for k, v in api_calls.items() %}<tr><td>{{ k }}</td><td class="num">{{ '{:,}'.format(v) }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="sub">Tokens in <b>{{ '{:,}'.format(cost.tokens_in) }}</b> ·
out <b>{{ '{:,}'.format(cost.tokens_out) }}</b> ·
cost <b>${{ '%.4f'|format(cost.cost_usd) }}</b>
{% for stage, c in cost.by_stage.items() %} · {{ stage }} ${{ '%.4f'|format(c.cost_usd) }}{% endfor %}</p>
</div>

<footer>
<p>This is a research and idea-generation tool. It surfaces candidates for a
human to evaluate. The scores are the output of a heuristic pipeline plus a
language model's interpretation, not a prediction. Every thesis ships with an
explicit invalidation condition specifically so that it can be checked and
thrown out. <b>Nothing here is investment advice.</b></p>
<p>The honest default assumption is that any new signal is worthless until
measured. See the information-coefficient tracker for whether this one is
earning its place.</p>
</footer>

</div></body></html>
